## Key Points to Cover
- Dependency types: Finish-to-Start, Start-to-Start, etc.
- Create dependencies via drag (Shift+drag) or detail panel
- Dependency validation catches circular and timeline conflicts
- Resource types: people, budget, assets
- Assign resources with capacity tracking
- Resource Allocation view shows demand vs capacity
- Resolve conflicts: reschedule, adjust, add capacity, parallelize
- Critical path determines minimum timeline

